{"reviewId": "231301956_7ZCpcy1p3", "review": {"abstract": "10年前的经验对后10年没有任何借鉴意义，必须追溯到50年前才更恰当。", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "chapterUid": 6, "content": "理论是这样，但是实际情况呢，康波周期在各个阶段，会不会因为突发事件，如战争，疫情，科技快速发展而错或者提前，所以国外的国家如日本发展的康波比我们自己 50 年前的时候更值得借鉴", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "range": "4324-4359", "createTime": 1745380728, "title": "", "type": 1, "reviewId": "231301956_7ZCpcy1p3", "userVid": 231301956, "topics": [], "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 6, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "author": {"userVid": 231301956, "name": "气清若兰", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/Szib8ySqErWJLdOYekxBy7ibpqjz411Kjhic3ibdAWRQfuFcsNZcnWxJUCiaVX9fcplBSsTFvpDd0icKU/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M3-0-200", "desc": "阅读天数", "title": "阅读天数", "levelIndex": 200}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 11, "likes": [{"userVid": 335213853, "name": "fyynova", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/xzvGWibJB8bEWzrIV5Hkmk55AtdSFDZmhlEWnctrw4JpGz1tpRyoxbA/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M2-0-100", "desc": "阅读时长", "title": "阅读时长", "levelIndex": 100}}], "commentsCount": 2, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": "应该具体问题具体分析，康波分析的是价格的波动，就看这些突发事件在 60 年的周期里，是否影响了价格的波动。可以想见，局部战争和个别行业的科技进步不是突发事件，因为在 60 年的周期里，这只能造成短期波动，而全世界范围的疫情和科技革命则有改变价格波动的能量。", "reviewId": "231301956_7ZCpcy1p3", "commentId": "231301956_7ZCpcy1p3_c3215729_87PSdYdui", "userVid": 3215729, "createTime": 1774318637, "author": {"userVid": 3215729, "name": "拿捏小面团", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/UcdjjDD5LEFyGn3703HBMuRribudnNC65U0r0PCsL8Hs9E6PiaOoy41U9UHfg5aLJ3h6IxARnCPvKicb3Xa9LlHB49mcjic8zeicvajibl2hDic4fI/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-100", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 100}}}, {"content": "肯定会的", "reviewId": "231301956_7ZCpcy1p3", "commentId": "231301956_7ZCpcy1p3_c329358279_81G1fqoPT", "userVid": 329358279, "createTime": 1752629213, "author": {"userVid": 329358279, "name": "杨高  ོayoungirl", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/siaocsm8DAoLcOcrTCUuMfvOHjlOMIAfDR6pgArBNgXeURFywXuPewibWrIick5aficfBfqcmJTLkv8/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M7-0-10", "desc": "想法发布", "title": "想法发布", "levelIndex": 10}}}], "dislikeCount": 0, "synckey": 1774318637}